    "message": "[Backport 5.x] fix(validation): lowercase header names in propertyNames enum/const (#7104)\n\nBackport of 35c32375731c111439682b2f9e6e0baed2694269 to `5.x`.\n\n- Lowercase header names in `propertyNames` `enum`/`const` in headers\nschemas\n- Document that regex header-name constraints are not case-normalized\n- Add `FSTSEC003` warning when a `$ref` is used inside `propertyNames`\nin a headers schema\n\nThe only conflict was in `lib/warnings.js`: `5.x` also has `FSTWRN004`\nand `FSTDEP022`–`FSTDEP025`, so both sets are kept.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01EeyumS5b9M4aQc8C2UCHJQ\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
